<title>USA: PROFFITT'S INC EXTENDS EXCHANGE OFFER.</title>
<headline>PROFFITT'S INC EXTENDS EXCHANGE OFFER.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department store retailer Proffitt's Inc said on Monday that it has extended its exchange offer to August 15.</p>
<p>The offer, to exchange registered series B 8-1/8 percent senior notes due 2004 for all outstanding unregistered series A 8-1/8 percent senior notes due 2004, was previously set to expire August 8.</p>
</text>
